  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana igoro y’okobambwa gwa Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche, ekero nachete ase more, baminto, tinachete kobaranderia oborori bwa Nyasae ase enchera y’obuya bwe chinkwana, gose ase obong’aini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki nigo narengereretie ng’a timanya ing’ana rinde rionsi ase more otatiga igoro ya Yeso Kristo, kobua mono okobambwa kwaye ase omosalaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche nigo narenge amo nainwe ase oboreu na okoiroka, na okoiguswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkwana yane na okorandia kwane tibiarenge amang’ana ay’okoebereria obong’aini bwa Mwanyabaanto, korende ase ekiorokererio ki’Omoika ne chinguru,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erinde okwegena kwaino tikoba ase obong’aini bwa Mwanyabaanto korende ase chinguru chia Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "ms"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obong’ani bwa Nyasae",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende obong’aini mbore togoteeba ase egati y’abaikeranu, na borobwo tibori obong’aini bw’ense eye, gose obw’abagaambi b’ense eye abagendererete gochia gosira,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende nigo togokwana obong’aini bw’obobisi bwa Nyasae, obwo bwabisetwe, obwo Nyasae aroberetie korwa omochakano, erinde toegwe bobe obonene bwaito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaambi b’ense eye tibabomanyete, nonya noyomo obo; naki onye mbabomanyete, anga tibaabambete Omonene bw’obonene;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "korende buna eriikire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Aya eriso ritaroche, gose ogoto gotaigwete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gose aya atarengereirie ase enkoro y’omonto,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ayio Nyasae aroiseretie abamwanchete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Nyasae otoyaorokeirie ase Omoika oye, naki Omoika nigo okorigia onsi, nonya nobobisi bwa Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki ning’o ore ase Mwanyabaanto omanyete ebirengererio bi’omonto, otatiga omoika bw’omonto ore ime yaye? Naboigo nonde tari omanyete ebirengererio bia Nyasae otatiga Omoika o Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na intwe titwanyorete omoika bw’ense eye, korende Omoika orwete ase Nyasae, erinde tonyare komanya ebiegwa ebitwaeirwe na Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naro nigo tokoyakwana, tari ase amang’ana tworokererigwe ne chisemi chia Mwanyabaanto, korende aya tworokererigwe n’Omoika; igo togokwana amang’ana ’Omoika ase abare n’Omoika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo Mwanyabaanto ore ne chingencho chia kare, takonyora ebiegwa bi’Omoika o Nyasae, naki asare ere ebi nebiriri, gose takonyara kobimanya, ekiagera nigo bikomanyekana ase chinguru chi’Omoika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto ore n’Omoika nigo akomanya onsi, korende ere takomanyigwa na monto onde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naki ning’o omanyete ebirengererio bi’Omonene, erinde amworokererie?” Korende intwe ntore nebirengererio bia Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
